1 Environmental Restoration Management Action Plan</article-title><source>Hill Air Force Base, UT: Environmental Management and Response Section</source><comment>Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.em.hill.af.mil/restoration/Map02/hill.html">http://www.em.hill.af.mil/restoration/Map02/hill.html</ext-link></comment><access-date>[accessed 1 September 2005]</access-date></citation></ref><ref id="b18-ehp0116-001120"><citation citation-type="web"><collab>U.S. Census Bureau</collab><year>2005</year><source>Census Block Groups: Cartographic Boundary Files Descriptions and Metadata</source><comment>Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.census.gov/geo/www/cob/bg_metadata.html">http://www.census.gov/geo/www/cob/bg_metadata.html</ext-link></comment><access-date>[accessed 31 December 2007]</access-date></citation></ref><ref id="b19-ehp0116-001120"><citation citation-type="book"><collab>Utah Cancer Registry</collab><year>2006</year><source>Utah Cancer Registry Policy and Procedures Guide: Request for Registry Data</source><publisher-loc>Salt Lake City, UT</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Utah Cancer Registry</publisher-name><comment>Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://ucr.utah.edu/docs/PandPRequestRegistryDataComplete.pdf">http://ucr.utah.edu/docs/PandPRequestRegistryDataComplete.pdf</ext-link></comment><access-date>[accessed 31 December 2007]</access-date></citation></ref><ref id="b20-ehp0116-001120"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Williams</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Keller</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Contreras</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><year>2003</year><source>An Investigation of Cancer Incidence in Sunset and Clinton, Utah, 1973&#x02013;1999</source><publisher-loc>Salt Lake City, UT</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Utah Department of Health</publisher-nam